          "tool_output": "# Q3 2026 Sales Report \u2014 James Okafor's Won Deals\n\n## Overview\n\nThis report highlights the three deals closed and won by **James Okafor** during Q3 2026,\nidentified as Deal IDs **D001**, **D003**, and **D006** in the sales records.\n\n## Won Deals Summary\n\n| Deal ID | Rep          | Region | Product              |    Amount | Close Date | Status |\n|---------|--------------|--------|----------------------|----------:|------------|--------|\n| D001    | James Okafor | North  | Meridian Insights Pro | $87,500  | 2026-07-05 | Won    |\n| D003    | James Okafor | East   | Meridian DataBridge   | $43,000  | 2026-07-12 | Won    |\n| D006    | James Okafor | South  | Meridian Insights Pro | $120,000 | 2026-07-22 | Won    |\n\n## Key Metrics\n\n- **Total Won Revenue:** $250,500\n- **Number of Deals Won:** 3\n- **Average Deal Size:** $83,500\n\n## Product Breakdown\n\n| Product              | Deals | Total Revenue |\n|----------------------|------:|--------------:|\n| Meridian Insights Pro |     2 |      $207,500 |\n| Meridian DataBridge   |     1 |       $43,000 |\n\n## Regional Coverage\n\n| Region | Deal ID | Amount   |\n|--------|---------|----------|\n| North  | D001    | $87,500  |\n| East   | D003    | $43,000  |\n| South  | D006    | $120,000 |\n\n## Timeline\n\nAll three deals were closed within **July 2026**, demonstrating strong early-quarter momentum:\n\n1. **D001** \u2014 July 5, 2026 (Meridian Insights Pro, North)\n2. **D003** \u2014 July 12, 2026 (Meridian DataBridge, East)\n3. **D006** \u2014 July 22, 2026 (Meridian Insights Pro, South)\n\n## Notes\n\n- James Okafor's largest single deal was **D006** at **$120,000** (Meridian Insights Pro, South region).\n- Meridian Insights Pro accounted for **83%** of his won revenue ($207,500 of $250,500).\n- All deals spanned three different regions (North, East, South), showing broad geographic reach.\n\n---\n\n*Source: workspace/data/sales_q3.csv*\n",
